        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "也就是依据气脉凝聚的位置来确定。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book029-b002006-p000-1c6351df39",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "地势对应龙脉的走向，山势对应龙骨的形态，龙脉蜿蜒曲折，东西延伸，或是南北走向。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book029-b002007-p000-3c6fcc23a4",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "这和“丘垄之骨”的意思是一样的。所谓“东西南北”，是说龙脉的活动变化没有固定的形态，并非被方位所拘束。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
